    Dev["Web Developer / Student (Primary User - Browser)"]
    Instructor["Team Lead / Capstone Instructor (Academic Reviewer)"]

    Scanner["Lightweight OWASP Top 10 Vulnerability Scanner (Local FastAPI Web App & Engine - Docker / Python venv)"]

    LocalApp["Developer Local Web App (localhost / host.docker.internal)"]
    Testbench["Validation Testbench Targets (DVWA, OWASP Juice Shop, Local VulnBench)"]
    Reports["Local Filesystem Exports (JSON & Standalone HTML Developer Reports)"]

    Dev -->|"Manages projects, launches scans, views SSE progress & code fixes (HTTP/SSE :8000)"| Scanner
    Instructor -->|"Reviews vulnerability trends, triage states & exported reports"| Scanner
    Scanner -->|"Sends allow-listed, rate-limited non-destructive HTTP probes"| LocalApp
    Scanner -->|"Executes automated benchmark scans on isolated Docker network"| Testbench
    Scanner -->|"Exports downloadable developer reports"| Reports
    LocalApp -->|"Returns HTTP responses, headers, cookies & HTML forms"| Scanner
    Testbench -->|"Returns HTTP responses for Precision/Recall evaluation"| Scanner
